"""
Version 10's response to the review of version 9 (25 findings, consolidated 12 October 2026, with the repository at commit
ff71e09): each finding reproduced on version 9's code before it was fixed (the reproductions are named in the text), each
rule finding checked on the firm's own page (rules_inventory_v10.json), with what was wrong and what version 10 does.
[[KEY]] fields are filled from the version 10 results when the document is built ([[T:name]] is the result line of test
'name' in tests_v10.json). NEW lists the errors found by our own audit of version 9 and of the version 10 work; INTRO and
PROCESS say why the review found its errors before we did and what changed in how the document is checked. PRIOR summarises
the earlier reviews.
"""

